      "content": "hey so i was moving some heavy boxes earlier and felt this really sharp pop in my lower back. now it’s like a constant ache and i get these weird shooting pains down my left leg. my foot feels kind of heavy too like i cant lift it as easy as usual. i think i just need to get the muscles loose again... do u think if i do some really deep, aggressive stretching or try to crack my back hard it'll help reset everything?",
